/**
 * CAELUS Enterprise — Operational Risk, Continuity & Decision Intelligence Workbench
 * (ui/app.js — Vanilla JS, Zero External Dependencies)
 *
 * Runtime Architecture (Strict Engine Authenticity — No Fake Local JS Engine):
 * 1. Live C++17 / Rust FFI Engine via WebSocket (ws://127.0.0.1:47809)
 * 2. Embedded WebAssembly Core (window.CAELUS_WASM_B64 + window.CAELUS_SCENARIOS)
 * 3. Offline / Disconnected State: Explicitly informs the user when neither real
 *    engine is connected; never runs a divergent JavaScript model disguised as
 *    the signed C++/Rust engine.
 *
 * Security: All dynamic DOM updates and HTML exports escape untrusted strings via
 * escapeHtml() or use textContent.
 */

